nativmix (1.0.14-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: declare python3-mido dependency on Debian/Ubuntu (apt install pulls mido)
  * Fix: drop optional bundled mido from .deb rules (bundling remains Fedora/RPM only)

